# Codegen output. The schema.graphql at the repo root is the offline source
# of truth (committed); the per-package generated TS lives under __generated__/
# and is rebuilt on every `pnpm codegen`/`pnpm typecheck`/`pnpm build`.
**/__generated__/

# Inlined SDL for graphql_inspect_schema; copied from repo-root schema.graphql on `pnpm codegen`.
packages/mcp/mcp-server-admin/src/tools/graphql/schema-snapshot.graphql

# Vite-built MCP App views, rebuilt by `pnpm prebuild` / `pnpm build:ui`.
**/src/ui/generated/

# MCP docs sync payload — generated on release / Sanity sync workflows, not committed.
packages/mcp/mcp/docs/mcp-guide-sync.json
